          "docs": "Lists all commercial conditions on the store. \r\n## Response body example\r\n\r\n```json\r\n[\r\n    {\r\n        \"Id\": 1,\r\n        \"Name\": \"Padrão\",\r\n        \"IsDefault\": true\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n        \"Id\": 2,\r\n        \"Name\": \"Teste Fast\",\r\n        \"IsDefault\": false\r\n    }\r\n]\r\n```"
